    Proxy reachability
    Feishu user OAuth scopes
    WebSocket event-bus state
    Active WebSocket consumers
    Main LaunchAgent state
    Dashboard LaunchAgent state
    Dashboard API availability

The repository also includes tests for:

    Knowledge access
    SQLite inbox state
    Workflow classification
    Polling filters and windows
    Recent image and file isolation
    Pagination completeness
    Retry policy
    Subprocess timeout and termination
    Pending confirmations
    Log maintenance
    Per-chat serial queues
    Interruptible delays
    Singleton locking
