FINAL NOTE

AIPRO is a practical operating system for an authorized AI digital human, not
just a conversational demo. Its value comes from the complete loop:

    Detect the right message
    Preserve identity and context
    Decide what is safe
    Execute useful work
    Return the result to the original conversation
    Record what happened
    Recover when a component fails
    Give the owner a visible control surface

Use it only with explicit authorization and appropriate organizational
governance.
